<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 2ND DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 2ND DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day</p>
<p>of the third cricket test between New Zealand and England at</p>
<p>Lancaster Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings (overnight 229 for five wickets)</p>
<p> B.Young b Cork			  11</p>
<p> B.Pocock c Atherton b Croft	 22</p>
<p> M.Horne c Thorpe b Gough	    42</p>
