<p> G.Allott not out			 8</p>
<p> Extras (b-1, lb-16, nb-19)	  36</p>
<p>   Total				  346</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14 2-78 3-106 4-137 5-201 6-283 7-288</p>
<p>8-310 9-337.</p>
